// Ch7 B04 "The galleries" (docs/kb/story/beats/act1_ch07.md §2 B04). R01: the stilt galleries
// inside the gantry, tier on tier round the catch-pool, packed. R02: up from the galleries into the
// Bell's mouth, the drop hanging perfectly still. Toma and Asha in the third gallery (Toma's boyhood
// seat; he hasn't played since the Stillguard oath, toma_okeru.md). Liss's line is the voice guide's
// sample, verbatim but for the stress the box can't show yet ("*not looking*"). NOBODY ANSWERS IT:
// Toma looks up and says nothing (his cracks start here), Asha holds neutral for 1.5 s in close
// (R01A, inside R01's axis) while the bell_hum layer rises under her (Audio: a steady tone, no
// breath), Ysolde turns a page, 2 s of crowd. R02K, R02's reverse through a salt-glass panel: Kerrid
// knee-deep at the end of the river moorings outside, back to the Bell. He doesn't go under bound
// light he can't account for; played as a man who doesn't like crowds. Rhen is already going down to
// the pool; the flow puts him on the pool steps after this, with the checkpoint autosave (§5.1).
// Watch (ADR 0017 Ch7): no Order official in any gallery shot, no Stillguard, no Level banners.
title: ch07_galleries
location: ch07/tamsule_bell_galleries
---
@letterbox on
@camera R01
@music tidecup_crowd fade=1.0
@wait 1.5
@camera R02
@wait 2.5
@camera R01
Toma [soft_smile]: Haluna sat there. That gallery. We lost every match for six years. #line:ch07_gall_001
Asha [surprised]: You never told me you played. #line:ch07_gall_002
Toma [smile]: I was large. They put me in the ring and asked me not to move. #line:ch07_gall_003
@anim asha laugh
@anim toma look_at column_foot
@wait 1.5
@anim liss look_at bell_ribs
Liss [cold]: Rust it, the Bell's glimmer-made. You're all just not looking at it. #line:ch07_gall_004
@wait 1.0
@anim toma look_at bell_ribs
@camera R01A
@face asha neutral 1.5
@sfx bell_hum_rise
@wait 1.5
@camera R01
@anim ysolde turn_page
@wait 2.0
@camera R02K
@wait 2.0
@camera R01
@wait 1.0
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
